---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---

<Base title="Accueil">

<section class="hero fade-in">
    <h1>Apprends le calcul mental<br />avec le <span class="highlight">soroban</span></h1>
    <p class="hero-sub">Des cours en ligne avec un suivi personnalisé pour chaque enfant.<br />Ludiques, progressifs, et efficaces.</p>
    <div class="hero-buttons">
      <a href="/reservation" class="cta cta-pulse cta-shine">Cours d'essai · 5€</a>
      <a href="/tarifs" class="cta-secondary cta-shine">Voir nos formules</a>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="benefices fade-right">
    <h2 class="section-title">Pourquoi le <span class="highlight">soroban</span> ?</h2>
    <div class="roue-section">
      <div class="roue">
        <div class="roue-fond"></div>
        <div class="roue-indicateur"></div>
        <div class="roue-traits"></div>
        <div class="roue-zones" role="tablist" aria-label="Les bienfaits du soroban">
          <button class="roue-zone z0" role="tab" id="roue-tab-0" aria-controls="roue-texte-0" aria-selected="true" style="--c: var(--corail);"><span><svg width="30" height="30" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M12 18V5"/><path d="M15 13a4.17 4.17 0 0 1-3-4 4.17 4.17 0 0 1-3 4"/><path d="M17.598 6.5A3 3 0 1 0 12 5a3 3 0 1 0-5.598 1.5"/><path d="M17.997 5.125a4 4 0 0 1 2.526 5.77"/><path d="M18 18a4 4 0 0 0 2-7.464"/><path d="M19.967 17.483A4 4 0 1 1 12 18a4 4 0 1 1-7.967-.517"/><path d="M6 18a4 4 0 0 1-2-7.464"/><path d="M6.003 5.125a4 4 0 0 0-2.526 5.77"/></svg><b>Calcul<br />mental</b></span></button>
          <button class="roue-zone z1" role="tab" id="roue-tab-1" aria-controls="roue-texte-1" aria-selected="false" style="--c: var(--jaune);"><span><svg width="30" height="30" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"/><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="6"/><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="2"/></svg><b>Concen-<br />tration</b></span></button>
          <button class="roue-zone z2" role="tab" id="roue-tab-2" aria-controls="roue-texte-2" aria-selected="false" style="--c: var(--corail);"><span><svg width="30" height="30" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M11.017 2.814a1 1 0 0 1 1.966 0l1.051 5.558a2 2 0 0 0 1.594 1.594l5.558 1.051a1 1 0 0 1 0 1.966l-5.558 1.051a2 2 0 0 0-1.594 1.594l-1.051 5.558a1 1 0 0 1-1.966 0l-1.051-5.558a2 2 0 0 0-1.594-1.594l-5.558-1.051a1 1 0 0 1 0-1.966l5.558-1.051a2 2 0 0 0 1.594-1.594z"/><path d="M20 2v4"/><path d="M22 4h-4"/><circle cx="4" cy="20" r="2"/></svg><b>Confiance<br />en soi</b></span></button>
          <button class="roue-zone z3" role="tab" id="roue-tab-3" aria-controls="roue-texte-3" aria-selected="false" style="--c: var(--jaune);"><span><svg width="30" height="30" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M15.39 4.39a1 1 0 0 0 1.68-.474 2.5 2.5 0 1 1 3.014 3.015 1 1 0 0 0-.474 1.68l1.683 1.682a2.414 2.414 0 0 1 0 3.414L19.61 15.39a1 1 0 0 1-1.68-.474 2.5 2.5 0 1 0-3.014 3.015 1 1 0 0 1 .474 1.68l-1.683 1.682a2.414 2.414 0 0 1-3.414 0L8.61 19.61a1 1 0 0 0-1.68.474 2.5 2.5 0 1 1-3.014-3.015 1 1 0 0 0 .474-1.68l-1.683-1.682a2.414 2.414 0 0 1 0-3.414L4.39 8.61a1 1 0 0 1 1.68.474 2.5 2.5 0 1 0 3.014-3.015 1 1 0 0 1-.474-1.68l1.683-1.682a2.414 2.414 0 0 1 3.414 0z"/></svg><b>Stimulation<br />cérébrale</b></span></button>
        </div>
        <div class="roue-centre"><img src="/logo.png" alt="" /></div>
      </div>
      <div class="roue-textes">
        <div class="roue-texte is-active" role="tabpanel" id="roue-texte-0" aria-labelledby="roue-tab-0" style="--c: var(--corail);">
          <span class="roue-texte-icon"><svg width="26" height="26" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M12 18V5"/><path d="M15 13a4.17 4.17 0 0 1-3-4 4.17 4.17 0 0 1-3 4"/><path d="M17.598 6.5A3 3 0 1 0 12 5a3 3 0 1 0-5.598 1.5"/><path d="M17.997 5.125a4 4 0 0 1 2.526 5.77"/><path d="M18 18a4 4 0 0 0 2-7.464"/><path d="M19.967 17.483A4 4 0 1 1 12 18a4 4 0 1 1-7.967-.517"/><path d="M6 18a4 4 0 0 1-2-7.464"/><path d="M6.003 5.125a4 4 0 0 0-2.526 5.77"/></svg></span>
          <h3>Calcul mental</h3>
          <span class="roue-sous-titre">Calculer vite, sans calculatrice</span>
          <p>Ton enfant apprend à visualiser le boulier mentalement pour calculer à une vitesse fulgurante, sans calculatrice.</p>
          <a href="/reservation" class="roue-cta">Réserver un cours d'essai <svg class="arrow" width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M5 12h14"/><path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7"/></svg></a>
        </div>
        <div class="roue-texte" role="tabpanel" id="roue-texte-1" aria-labelledby="roue-tab-1" style="--c: var(--jaune);">
          <span class="roue-texte-icon"><svg width="26" height="26" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"/><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="6"/><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="2"/></svg></span>
          <h3>Concentration</h3>
          <span class="roue-sous-titre">Une attention qui se muscle</span>
          <p>Manipuler les perles demande une attention totale. Cette habitude se transfère dans toutes les matières à l'école.</p>
          <a href="/reservation" class="roue-cta">Réserver un cours d'essai <svg class="arrow" width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M5 12h14"/><path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7"/></svg></a>
        </div>
        <div class="roue-texte" role="tabpanel" id="roue-texte-2" aria-labelledby="roue-tab-2" style="--c: var(--corail);">
          <span class="roue-texte-icon"><svg width="26" height="26" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M11.017 2.814a1 1 0 0 1 1.966 0l1.051 5.558a2 2 0 0 0 1.594 1.594l5.558 1.051a1 1 0 0 1 0 1.966l-5.558 1.051a2 2 0 0 0-1.594 1.594l-1.051 5.558a1 1 0 0 1-1.966 0l-1.051-5.558a2 2 0 0 0-1.594-1.594l-5.558-1.051a1 1 0 0 1 0-1.966l5.558-1.051a2 2 0 0 0 1.594-1.594z"/><path d="M20 2v4"/><path d="M22 4h-4"/><circle cx="4" cy="20" r="2"/></svg></span>
          <h3>Confiance en soi</h3>
          <span class="roue-sous-titre">Le plaisir d'apprendre retrouvé</span>
          <p>Fini les « je suis nul en maths ». En maîtrisant le calcul, ton enfant retrouve le plaisir d'apprendre.</p>
          <a href="/reservation" class="roue-cta">Réserver un cours d'essai <svg class="arrow" width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M5 12h14"/><path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7"/></svg></a>
        </div>
        <div class="roue-texte" role="tabpanel" id="roue-texte-3" aria-labelledby="roue-tab-3" style="--c: var(--jaune);">
          <span class="roue-texte-icon"><svg width="26" height="26" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M15.39 4.39a1 1 0 0 0 1.68-.474 2.5 2.5 0 1 1 3.014 3.015 1 1 0 0 0-.474 1.68l1.683 1.682a2.414 2.414 0 0 1 0 3.414L19.61 15.39a1 1 0 0 1-1.68-.474 2.5 2.5 0 1 0-3.014 3.015 1 1 0 0 1 .474 1.68l-1.683 1.682a2.414 2.414 0 0 1-3.414 0L8.61 19.61a1 1 0 0 0-1.68.474 2.5 2.5 0 1 1-3.014-3.015 1 1 0 0 0 .474-1.68l-1.683-1.682a2.414 2.414 0 0 1 0-3.414L4.39 8.61a1 1 0 0 1 1.68.474 2.5 2.5 0 1 0 3.014-3.015 1 1 0 0 1-.474-1.68l1.683-1.682a2.414 2.414 0 0 1 3.414 0z"/></svg></span>
          <h3>Stimulation cérébrale</h3>
          <span class="roue-sous-titre">Logique et créativité réunies</span>
          <p>Le soroban active les deux hémisphères du cerveau : la logique à gauche, la visualisation et la créativité à droite.</p>
          <a href="/reservation" class="roue-cta">Réserver un cours d'essai <svg class="arrow" width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M5 12h14"/><path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7"/></svg></a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="chiffres fade-in">
    <div class="chiffres-bandeau">
      <a href="/temoignages" class="chiffre-item chiffre-link">
        <span class="chiffre-num" data-target="40">0</span>
        <span class="chiffre-suffix">+</span>
        <p>élèves accompagnés</p>
      </a>
      <a href="/temoignages" class="chiffre-item chiffre-link">
        <span class="chiffre-num" data-target="10">0</span>
        <span class="chiffre-suffix">+</span>
        <p>ans d'expérience</p>
      </a>
      <a href="/tarifs" class="chiffre-item chiffre-link">
        <span class="chiffre-num" data-target="9">0</span>
        <span class="chiffre-suffix"></span>
        <p>niveaux progressifs</p>
      </a>
      <a href="/reservation" class="chiffre-item chiffre-link">
        <span class="chiffre-num" data-target="5">0</span>
        <span class="chiffre-suffix">€</span>
        <p>le cours d'essai</p>
      </a>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="temoignages-home fade-left">
    <h2 class="section-title">Les parents <span class="highlight">racontent</span></h2>
    <div class="slider" id="temoignage-slider">
      <div class="slide active">
        <div class="stars"><svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="#F5A623" stroke="#F5A623" stroke-width="2"><path d="M11.525 2.295a.53.53 0 0 1 .95 0l2.31 4.679a2.123 2.123 0 0 0 1.595 1.16l5.166.756a.53.53 0 0 1 .294.904l-3.736 3.638a2.123 2.123 0 0 0-.611 1.878l.882 5.14a.53.53 0 0 1-.771.56l-4.618-2.428a2.122 2.122 0 0 0-1.973 0L6.396 21.01a.53.53 0 0 1-.77-.56l.881-5.139a2.122 2.122 0 0 0-.611-1.879L2.16 9.795a.53.53 0 0 1 .294-.906l5.165-.755a2.122 2.122 0 0 0 1.597-1.16z"/></svg><svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="#F5A623" stroke="#F5A623" stroke-width="2"><path d="M11.525 2.295a.53.53 0 0 1 .95 0l2.31 4.679a2.123 2.123 0 0 0 1.595 1.16l5.166.756a.53.53 0 0 1 .294.904l-3.736 3.638a2.123 2.123 0 0 0-.611 1.878l.882 5.14a.53.53 0 0 1-.771.56l-4.618-2.428a2.122 2.122 0 0 0-1.973 0L6.396 21.01a.53.53 0 0 1-.77-.56l.881-5.139a2.122 2.122 0 0 0-.611-1.879L2.16 9.795a.53.53 0 0 1 .294-.906l5.165-.755a2.122 2.122 0 0 0 1.597-1.16z"/></svg><svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="#F5A623" stroke="#F5A623" stroke-width="2"><path d="M11.525 2.295a.53.53 0 0 1 .95 0l2.31 4.679a2.123 2.123 0 0 0 1.595 1.16l5.166.756a.53.53 0 0 1 .294.904l-3.736 3.638a2.123 2.123 0 0 0-.611 1.878l.882 5.14a.53.53 0 0 1-.771.56l-4.618-2.428a2.122 2.122 0 0 0-1.973 0L6.396 21.01a.53.53 0 0 1-.77-.56l.881-5.139a2.122 2.122 0 0 0-.611-1.879L2.16 9.795a.53.53 0 0 1 .294-.906l5.165-.755a2.122 2.122 0 0 0 1.597-1.16z"/></svg><svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="#F5A623" stroke="#F5A623" stroke-width="2"><path d="M11.525 2.295a.53.53 0 0 1 .95 0l2.31 4.679a2.123 2.123 0 0 0 1.595 1.16l5.166.756a.53.53 0 0 1 .294.904l-3.736 3.638a2.123 2.123 0 0 0-.611 1.878l.882 5.14a.53.53 0 0 1-.771.56l-4.618-2.428a2.122 2.122 0 0 0-1.973 0L6.396 21.01a.53.53 0 0 1-.77-.56l.881-5.139a2.122 2.122 0 0 0-.611-1.879L2.16 9.795a.53.53 0 0 1 .294-.906l5.165-.755a2.122 2.122 0 0 0 1.597-1.16z"/></svg><svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="#F5